    "message": "Let generated Scenarios open temporary spaces\n\nadd_temporary_space could not run on a Scenario made in the UI (#80):\n\n- temporary_spaces_v1 exists only when simulator_extensions.enabled is\n  set, and the generator did not set it;\n- with it set, the EffectProgram state check rejected the scheduled\n  events because the operator was missing from its event-type table;\n- with that fixed, the handler looked up the approved program in\n  temporary_spaces_v1, which has no programs, so every start and\n  expiry failed.\n\nNew generated Scenarios now enable the extension (the only state it\nadds for them is temporary_spaces_v1) and record its assumption. The\nhandler reads programs from the EffectProgram state, and the table\nlists the operator. Scenarios saved before this keep running without\nthe state, so their Checkpoints still restore.\n\nThe pinned generated_small run gets new Scenario and final-state\nhashes; its realized events are unchanged. The model registry now\nsays the state is enabled by simulator_extensions.enabled, which is\nwhat the code does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
